nebula changelog

1.1.0 (2026-07-24 by Dian Yu)
  - Add variable phonon domain per material (--phonon-domain)
  - Add variable initial material for primary electrons (--initial-material)
  - Add origin z position (escape depth), lineage tag (thanks Jonathan Choi) and event ID to electrons
  - New file formats for primary, detected electron and energy deposit files (see README)
  - Add nebula_cpu_all_events program recording every scattering and boundary event
  - Prescan speedup (GPU version)
  - Increase EPSILON by an order of magnitude to suppress electrons leaking from the geometry
  - Add example scripts for setting up, running and analysing simulations (script_examples)

1.0.3 (WIP)
  - (No real code change) Drop support for C++11 and CUDA <9.2; add support for modern versions of CUDA.

1.0.2 (2021-05-26)
  - Fix bug where only partial simulations were done when a low number of primaries are provided (GPU version).

1.0.1 (2021-02-16)
  - Add support for Windows (thanks Alexander Skorikov)
  - Support CUDA Toolkit 11 (thanks Alexander Skorikov)
  - Add upper energy bound to simulations

1.0.0 (2020-06-02)
  - Initial release
